(PointNXT MCP - Complete Technical Context) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Document scope) Tj T*
(This document describes the current repository implementation only. It does not invent backend) Tj T*
(APIs or claim unsupported capabilities.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Project overview) Tj T*
(PointNXT MCP is a read-only Model Context Protocol server for retrieving PointNXT commerce) Tj T*
(data through an AI assistant. The architecture is MCP client -> server.py -> domain tools ->) Tj T*
(services/pointnxt_api.py -> PointNXT backend. It is intended for operational users working) Tj T*
(with orders, customers, products, inventory summaries, shipments, returns, and business) Tj T*
(indicators.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Architecture and files) Tj T*
(server.py creates MCPServer\("PointNXT MCP"\), installs MCPSessionMiddleware, registers prompts,) Tj T*
(auth routes, and tools. tools/orders.py handles order queries and summaries.) Tj T*
(tools/customers.py derives customer views from orders. tools/products.py handles catalog and) Tj T*
(backend-provided inventory fields. tools/shipments.py derives shipment/fulfillment views from) Tj T*
(orders. tools/returns.py derives return views from orders. tools/business.py composes read-) Tj T*
(only business summaries. tools/auth.py handles browser and credential login. tools/system.py) Tj T*
(exposes diagnostics.) Tj T*
(services/pointnxt_api.py is the shared HTTP client. services/auth_session.py,) Tj T*
(session_store.py, request_context.py, and mcp_session_middleware.py manage authentication) Tj T*
(context. services/validation.py contains shared validation. services/metrics.py records) Tj T*
(process-local metrics. prompts.py registers reporting prompts. Dockerfile/docker-compose.yml) Tj T*
(provide deployment configuration.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Registered MCP tools) Tj T*
(Authentication: current_user, auth_status, authenticate_with_pointnxt, login_with_credentials,) Tj T*
(logout_pointnxt.) Tj T*
(Orders: get_orders, get_order_by_id, search_orders, get_order, get_orders_summary,) Tj T*
(get_order_stats, get_status_transitions.) Tj T*
(Customers: find_customer, get_customer_context.) Tj T*
(Products: get_products, get_product_by_id, search_products, get_product, get_product_summary.) Tj T*
(Inventory: search_inventory, get_inventory_summary.) Tj T*
(Shipments/fulfillment: search_shipments, get_order_shipments, get_fulfillment_queue.) Tj T*
(Returns: search_returns, get_order_returns.) Tj T*
(Business: get_business_summary, get_attention_queue.) Tj T*
(System: check_backend_health, check_authentication, check_configuration, get_mcp_metrics.) Tj T*
(All commerce tools are read-only. Login, logout, and token refresh modify authentication state) Tj T*
(only.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Confirmed backend endpoints) Tj T*
(POST /auth/login; POST /auth/logout; configured refresh endpoint, default /auth/refresh-token;) Tj T*
(GET /commerce/orders; GET /commerce/orders/{order_id}; GET /commerce/orders/stats; GET) Tj T*
(/commerce/orders/status-transitions; GET /commerce/products; GET) Tj T*
(/commerce/products/{product_id}; GET /commerce/products/summary.) Tj T*
(No dedicated customer, inventory, shipment, return, refund, or analytics endpoint is confirmed) Tj T*
(in the source.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Orders) Tj T*
(get_orders is the legacy/raw paginated order query. Supported filters include order status,) Tj T*
(payment method, channel, seller, warehouse, customer ID, dateFrom/dateTo, order) Tj T*
(number/reference, customer email, customer phone, and channel order ID. Statuses are validated) Tj T*
(against the supported PointNXT order status set. Dates use YYYY-MM-DD. Core limits are) Tj T*
(positive and capped at 100.) Tj T*
ET
